# WinUI XAML language service: exclude the C# server sources, build output, and test fixtures.
# The published server (dist/server, from `bundle:server`) DOES ship -- Native AOT executables per
# architecture plus the framework-dependent generator host, with no .NET runtime. Symbols/docs trimmed.
server/**
test/**
.vscode-test.mjs
server-test.log
dist/server/**/*.pdb
dist/server/**/*.xml
# Native-linker intermediates. The AOT publish output is clean today, but an SDK or PublishAot
# change that leaves an import library behind would otherwise ship it silently, and native
# artifacts now dominate the VSIX. validate-vsix-server.ps1 rejects these too.
dist/server/**/*.lib
dist/server/**/*.exp
dist/server/**/*.ilk
dist/server/**/*.obj
winapp.yaml
